Package: ImageFilter
Title: This package can be used on images to convert the colors of each pixel to grey, red, green or blue.
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Larissa", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: two functions, i) takes an RGB hexadecimal value and converts it to grey, red, green or blue, and ii) goes pixel by pixel (or vector by vector) through a bitmap (image) and runs the conversion function on that specific pixel to convert its color.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
